<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.90		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			 22,418		   11,027</p>
<p> Revs		     132,479		   95,213</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,857		   24,655</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.71		    $0.90</p>
<p> Net			 42,543		   22,120</p>
<p> Revs		     250,741		  183,640</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,841		   24,628</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1996 net includes $1.2 million, or $0.05 a share, gain from discontinued operations, while six-month 1996 net includes $2.8 million, or $0.12, gain from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
